                        "entry_id": "4a5d95a2-2c5a-3177-9586-13580ceb0cbf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something sold at a discount of two for the price of one."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "also",
                            "attributive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8fb761e-4327-4d97-8b35-7694ccbc6c1a",
                                "sense_id": "aee9b6cc-6def-344d-bf8e-283fabef003f",
                                "text": "I dashed into the mall; bought a gift; raced to the card store, snapped up a two-fer gift-bag special and was back in my car in 26 minutes. I could medal in power shopping."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "498ea43b-9272-4069-b8ed-1f51b75e7c41",
                                "sense_id": "aee9b6cc-6def-344d-bf8e-283fabef003f",
                                "text": "Thus, it was interesting to see that when the ISO 55001 Asset Management Standard was released last year, it also looks for an asset-management program to deliver its own twofers and threefers."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d22419a1-aa61-36ee-be05-5ebea30c07d8",
                        "entry_id": "4a5d95a2-2c5a-3177-9586-13580ceb0cbf",
                        "glosses": [
